>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Proofread the sentence.</span> \n<span class=\"bullet\">Click on the incorrect word.</span> \n<span class=\"bullet\">Type in the correct word to complete the sentence.\n</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Use capital letters where necessary.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}], "type": "GIW", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 10, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Gloria</span>: Tell me again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob02re6aud12", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": " is the star of the show?", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "who you think", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Kevin</span>: It think it's Bobo the monkey, but", "type": "text"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob02re6aud13", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "about animals in show business?", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": " what do I know", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nGloria and Kevin talk about animal performers.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Listen to the audio. Type in the missing words. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}], "type": "TYP", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 11, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "The Natural World", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "An Inhuman Practice", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 12, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to be beaten", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to suffer from physical abuse", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: In some cases, animal stars have been beaten.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about nature.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "trainer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who conditions animals to do something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Animals have not been given food so that they will perform the way the trainers want them to.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "activist", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who campaigns (or fights) for some kind of social change ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Activists have called attention to the issue of animal abuse.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "a big push", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a determined action ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There has been a big push toward animal rights in the last decade or so.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "shift", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a movement ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This has resulted in a gradual shift away from using animals in TV shows.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "conditions", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the circumstances affecting the way in which animals live or work, especially with regard to their safety or well-being ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There has been a shift toward better conditions for animals that remain in the industry. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Asking for Clarification and Emphasizing a Point", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about.<br/><br/>You can emphasize a point by asking rhetorical questions. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You ask for clarification when it is not clear what the other person is referring to. You ask the other person to be more specific by giving you more information.  You can use <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span> to ask for clarification or for more information. An <span class=\"strong\">embedded question</span> is a question within another question or a statement. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <span class=\"italic\">Example:<br/></span><span class=\"strong\">Direct question:</span> <span class=\"italic\"> Who is the most popular animal TV star?</span><br/> <span class=\"strong\">Embedded question:</span> <span class=\"italic\"> Can you tell me who the most popular animal TV star is? </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Notice the structure of the <span class=\"strong\">embedded question</span>. When it contains an auxiliary or the verb to be, you must reverse the positions of the subject and the verb.  <br> <span class=\"italic\"><br>Example:<br/></span><span class=\"strong\">Direct question:</span> <span class=\"italic\">Is Buffy the most popular animal on TV? </span> <br/></span><span class=\"strong\">Embedded question:</span> <span class=\"italic\">Do you know if Buffy is the most popular animal TV star?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you want to make a point, rather than elicit an answer from someone, you can use <span class=\"strong\">rhetorical questions</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <span class=\"italic\">Example:<br/> Where did we go wrong as people? </span>(The speaker does not want an answer here, but rather wants to emphasize the point that she believes people have made a big mistake in their approach to the treatment of animals.)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Can you tell me who the most popular animal TV star is?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Do you know what we can do about this? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Where did we go wrong as people?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Showing That You Understand Someone's Feelings", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use <span class=\"strong\">must</span> followed by an adjective when you want to empathize with someone. When you empathize with someone, you show them that you understand their feelings.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here is the structure to follow:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "subject + must + verb + adjective", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">You <span class=\"strong\">must be surprised</span> to hear about the mistreatment of animals.<br/> The animals <span class=\"strong\">must be terrified</span> locked in their cages.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use either -ed adjectives or -ing adjectives.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Don't forget to include the verb before the adjective.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Patricia</span>: I just watched a documentary about animal abuse.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Jess</span>: That must be depressing.</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: It must be heartbreaking to see those images<br/><span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Yes, it is!", "type": "example"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mistreatment", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the act of treating an animal (or person) cruelly or unfairly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: That very animal may be a victim of mistreatment and abuse.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go online and find out what happened to popular TV animal stars.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read about them and write a short summary of their lives before, during and after their TV show performances.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your information with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about how the animals, trainers or owners must have felt.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I read and write about animal TV stars.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I try to talk about how they must feel.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask questions for clarification and to keep the conversation going.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}